    <item>
      <title>Getting 50 GB/S Back from the Apple Neural Engine</title>
      <link>https://eiln.github.io/posts/ane-dma.html</link>
      <description>RTL performance erratum in the Apple M3 Neural Engine throttles DRAM weight streaming throughput down to 17–19 GB&amp;#x2F;s from the nominal 45–60 GB&amp;#x2F;s. Avoiding the problematic path in the kernel DMA engine&amp;#x27;s speculative prefetch ring increased Llama 3.2 1B token throughput from 10.0 to 24.3 tokens&amp;#x2F;s.</description>
